# libexpat CVEs in Alpine base image — requires base image update from upstream.
# These are in the system XML parser library, not in our application code.
# Mitigated: frontend container only serves static files via nginx, does not parse XML.
# Review date: 2026-07-09
CVE-2026-56131
CVE-2026-56407
CVE-2026-56408

# c-ares CVE in Alpine base image — DNS resolver library.
# Frontend container uses nginx for static file serving, does not make outbound DNS queries.
# Review date: 2026-07-11
CVE-2026-33630

# curl/libcurl CVEs in Alpine base image — SMB connection reuse + cookie leak.
# Frontend container only serves static files via nginx, does not make outbound
# curl/SMB/cookie requests. Will resolve when Alpine updates curl to 8.20.
# Review date: 2026-07-14
CVE-2026-5773
CVE-2026-6276

# util-linux / libuuid CVEs in Alpine base image (nginx:alpine) — TOCTOU and privilege
# escalation in SUID mount(8) and related mount helpers.
# Not applicable: frontend container runs nginx for static file serving only.
# No SUID binaries invoked, no mount operations, no privileged contexts.
# apk upgrade added to Dockerfile to pull fix when Alpine backport is available.
# Review date: 2026-09-05
